          <rdf:li>Canon Compliant</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Fluff and Angst</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>friendship &amp; leadership &amp; learning &amp; teamwork</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>IN SPACE!</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>semi-linear narrative</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>entrapdak turns up for like half a second</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora gets to have nice things</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra gets to have nice things</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>spaceship-killer She-ra</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>lots of beta we live like space lesbians</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>every single member of the best friends squad has some form of meltdown</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>including Darla</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>four character studies and a space crisis</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>everyone both needs and gets a hug</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/F</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/M</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>No Archive Warnings Apply</rdf:li>
